window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a406-15e4090994e77174.json"]={sha256:"15e4090994e77174676f6b268758f89234af9acb78d3b96fe3d0bce356653403",value:{"id":"a406","title":"複消色差顯微物鏡","titleEn":"Apochromatic microscope objectives","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 100×/1.4 油浸複消色差物鏡為對象：從 Abbe 解析度與軸向景深建立規格邊界，推導二級光譜如何由玻璃的部分色散差決定、為何需要螢石類異常色散材料，說明齊明半球前鏡組如何把 NA 1.4 的光線角逐級降低，再談鏡片偏心與增透膜、蓋玻片厚度球差與校正環，最後以多波長 PSF 量測與 Strehl 預算完成驗收。","summaryEn":"Taking a 100×/1.4 oil-immersion apochromat as the object, the course sets the specification boundary from Abbe resolution and axial depth of field, derives how secondary spectrum is fixed by the partial-dispersion difference of the glasses and why fluorite-type anomalous-dispersion materials are needed, explains how the aplanatic hemispherical front group steps the NA 1.4 ray angles down, covers element decentration, antireflection coatings, cover-glass spherical aberration and the correction collar, and closes acceptance with multi-wavelength PSF measurement and a Strehl budget.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-design-fabrication","subcategoryTitle":"光學設計與精密加工","subcategoryTitleEn":"Optical design and precision fabrication","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-design-fabrication","learningTags":["optics","optics-design-fabrication","microscope"],"architectureFamily":"microscope","architectureNodes":[["齊明半球前鏡組","Aplanatic hemispherical front group"],["螢石與異常色散鏡片組","Fluorite and anomalous-dispersion lens groups"],["校正環與蓋玻片補償","Correction collar and cover-glass compensation"],["寬頻增透膜","Broadband antireflection coatings"],["筒鏡與無限遠共軛","Tube lens and infinity conjugate"],["PSF 與色差量測","PSF and chromatic metrology"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[4,5],[5,2]],"diagram":{"type":"microscope","labels":["齊明半球前鏡組","螢石與異常色散鏡片組","校正環與蓋玻片補償","寬頻增透膜","筒鏡與無限遠共軛"],"labelsEn":["Aplanatic hemispherical front group","Fluorite and anomalous-dispersion lens groups","Correction collar and cover-glass compensation","Broadband antireflection coatings","Tube lens and infinity conjugate"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"二級光譜練習：100× 物鏡配 200 mm 筒鏡，f_obj = 2 mm；NA 1.4 油浸在 550 nm 的單側景深 n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm。若用 N-BK7（ν = 64.2，P_gF = 0.535）與 F2（ν = 36.4，P_gF = 0.583）做消色差，g 線焦點偏離 Δf = f·ΔP/Δν = 2 mm×(−0.048/27.8) ≈ −3.4 µm，是景深的 8 倍，藍色影像必然模糊。改用異常色散對（ΔP ≈ 0.004、Δν ≈ 50），Δf ≈ 2 mm×8×10⁻⁵ = 0.16 µm，落在景深內。再算整機 Strehl：物鏡 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片殘差 20 nm，RSS ≈ 38 nm，Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] ≈ 0.83。若橫向色差為 0.1%，視場邊緣 125 µm 處紅藍錯位 125 nm，超過 196 nm 解析極限的一半，所以橫向色差規格也要訂在 0.05% 以下。數值皆為教學假設。","textEn":"Secondary-spectrum exercise: a 100× objective with a 200 mm tube lens has f_obj = 2 mm; NA 1.4 oil immersion at 550 nm gives a one-sided depth of field n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm. An achromat built from N-BK7 (ν = 64.2, P_gF = 0.535) and F2 (ν = 36.4, P_gF = 0.583) places the g-line focus at Δf = f·ΔP/Δν = 2 mm×(−0.048/27.8) ≈ −3.4 µm, 8 times the depth of field, so the blue image must blur. An anomalous-dispersion pair (ΔP ≈ 0.004, Δν ≈ 50) gives Δf ≈ 2 mm×8×10⁻⁵ = 0.16 µm, inside the depth of field. Now the system Strehl: objective 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass residual 20 nm give RSS ≈ 38 nm and Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] ≈ 0.83. With 0.1% lateral colour, red and blue are displaced by 125 nm at the 125 µm field edge, more than half the 196 nm resolution limit, so the lateral-colour specification must also be set below 0.05%. All numbers are teaching assumptions.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a406-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界」與「二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries\" and \"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a406-v12-01","title":"Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"顯微物鏡能分辨的最小週期由 Abbe 條件決定：d = λ/(2NA)，NA = n·sinα 是物方介質折射率與半孔徑角正弦的乘積，油浸以 n = 1.515 把 NA 推到 1.4。軸向解析度隨 NA 的平方改善，但景深也跟著縮到 1 µm 以下，於是任何波長之間的焦點差都必須小於景深，否則不同顏色的影像無法同時清晰；這正是複消色差物鏡存在的理由，色差規格要用景深為尺度來訂。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The finest period a microscope objective can resolve follows the Abbe condition d = λ/(2NA), where NA = n·sinα is the product of the object-space index and the sine of the half-aperture angle, and oil immersion with n = 1.515 pushes NA to 1.4. Axial resolution improves with the square of NA, but depth of field shrinks below 1 µm with it, so any focus difference between wavelengths must be smaller than that depth or the colours cannot be sharp simultaneously; this is exactly why apochromats exist, and chromatic specifications must be written in units of depth of field. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：100×/1.4 油浸物鏡在 λ = 550 nm：Abbe 極限 d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm，Rayleigh 判據 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm；軸向單側景深 n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm，全寬約 0.85 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a 100×/1.4 oil objective at λ = 550 nm the Abbe limit is d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm and the Rayleigh criterion 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm; the one-sided axial depth n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm, about 0.85 µm full width.","failure":"常見誤解：「放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher magnification always means better resolution.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-01-k1","title":"Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界","titleEn":"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries","text":"顯微物鏡能分辨的最小週期由 Abbe 條件決定：d = λ/(2NA)，NA = n·sinα 是物方介質折射率與半孔徑角正弦的乘積，油浸以 n = 1.515 把 NA 推到 1.4。軸向解析度隨 NA 的平方改善，但景深也跟著縮到 1 µm 以下，於是任何波長之間的焦點差都必須小於景深，否則不同顏色的影像無法同時清晰；這正是複消色差物鏡存在的理由，色差規格要用景深為尺度來訂。","textEn":"The finest period a microscope objective can resolve follows the Abbe condition d = λ/(2NA), where NA = n·sinα is the product of the object-space index and the sine of the half-aperture angle, and oil immersion with n = 1.515 pushes NA to 1.4. Axial resolution improves with the square of NA, but depth of field shrinks below 1 µm with it, so any focus difference between wavelengths must be smaller than that depth or the colours cannot be sharp simultaneously; this is exactly why apochromats exist, and chromatic specifications must be written in units of depth of field.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher magnification always means better resolution. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries\" is correct?","options":["放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","顯微物鏡能分辨的最小週期由 Abbe 條件決定：d = λ/(2NA)，NA = n·sinα 是物方介質折射率與半孔徑角正弦的乘積，油浸以 n = 1.515 把 NA 推到 1.4。","只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。"],"optionsEn":["Higher magnification always means better resolution.","The finest period a microscope objective can resolve follows the Abbe condition d = λ/(2NA), where NA = n·sinα is the product of the object-space index and the sine of the half-aperture angle, and oil immersion with n = 1.515 pushes NA to 1.4.","With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum."],"answer":1,"explanation":"顯微物鏡能分辨的最小週期由 Abbe 條件決定：d = λ/(2NA)，NA = n·sinα 是物方介質折射率與半孔徑角正弦的乘積，油浸以 n = 1.515 把 NA 推到 1.4。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The finest period a microscope objective can resolve follows the Abbe condition d = λ/(2NA), where NA = n·sinα is the product of the object-space index and the sine of the half-aperture angle, and oil immersion with n = 1.515 pushes NA to 1.4. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a406-v12-02","title":"Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界：定量估算","titleEn":"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：100×/1.4 油浸物鏡在 λ = 550 nm：Abbe 極限 d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm，Rayleigh 判據 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm；軸向單側景深 n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm，全寬約 0.85 µm。乾式 40×/0.95 的橫向極限為 290 nm，軸向景深 0.61 µm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a 100×/1.4 oil objective at λ = 550 nm the Abbe limit is d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm and the Rayleigh criterion 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm; the one-sided axial depth n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm, about 0.85 µm full width. A dry 40×/0.95 objective has a lateral limit of 290 nm and an axial depth of 0.61 µm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 100 nm 螢光珠或 Siemens 星形靶量測橫向 PSF 半高寬與最小可分辨週期，與 λ/(2NA) 比較；再沿 z 軸以 50 nm 步進掃描同一顆珠，量軸向強度分佈的半高寬，核對是否接近 n·λ/NA² 的預測，偏大表示實際 NA 不足或存在球差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the lateral PSF full width at half maximum and the smallest resolvable period with 100 nm fluorescent beads or a Siemens star target and compare with λ/(2NA); then scan the same bead along z in 50 nm steps, measure the axial intensity full width at half maximum and check it against the n·λ/NA² prediction, since a larger value indicates reduced effective NA or spherical aberration.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"100×/1.4 油浸物鏡在 λ = 550 nm：Abbe 極限 d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm，Rayleigh 判據 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm；軸向單側景深 n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm，全寬約 0.85 µm。乾式 40×/0.95 的橫向極限為 290 nm，軸向景深 0.61 µm。","textEn":"For a 100×/1.4 oil objective at λ = 550 nm the Abbe limit is d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm and the Rayleigh criterion 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm; the one-sided axial depth n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm, about 0.85 µm full width. A dry 40×/0.95 objective has a lateral limit of 290 nm and an axial depth of 0.61 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries\", which statement holds?","options":["鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。","油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。","100×/1.4 油浸物鏡在 λ = 550 nm：Abbe 極限 d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm，Rayleigh 判據 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm。"],"optionsEn":["A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.","Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.","For a 100×/1.4 oil objective at λ = 550 nm the Abbe limit is d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm and the Rayleigh criterion 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"100×/1.4 油浸物鏡在 λ = 550 nm：Abbe 極限 d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm，Rayleigh 判據 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm；軸向單側景深 n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm，全寬約 0.85 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a 100×/1.4 oil objective at λ = 550 nm the Abbe limit is d = 550/(2×1.4) ≈ 196 nm and the Rayleigh criterion 0.61λ/NA ≈ 240 nm; the one-sided axial depth n·λ/NA² = 1.515×0.55/1.96 ≈ 0.43 µm, about 0.85 µm full width. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a406-v12-03","title":"Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 100 nm 螢光珠或 Siemens 星形靶量測橫向 PSF 半高寬與最小可分辨週期，與 λ/(2NA) 比較；再沿 z 軸以 50 nm 步進掃描同一顆珠，量軸向強度分佈的半高寬，核對是否接近 n·λ/NA² 的預測，偏大表示實際 NA 不足或存在球差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the lateral PSF full width at half maximum and the smallest resolvable period with 100 nm fluorescent beads or a Siemens star target and compare with λ/(2NA); then scan the same bead along z in 50 nm steps, measure the axial intensity full width at half maximum and check it against the n·λ/NA² prediction, since a larger value indicates reduced effective NA or spherical aberration. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若浸油折射率與設計值不符或油膜中有氣泡，有效 NA 下降，橫向解析度從 196 nm 退化到 250 nm 以上，而物鏡本身並無缺陷，使用者卻以為物鏡不良。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the immersion oil index deviates from design or the oil film contains bubbles, the effective NA drops, lateral resolution degrades from 196 nm to above 250 nm, and the user blames an objective that is actually faultless.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 100 nm 螢光珠或 Siemens 星形靶量測橫向 PSF 半高寬與最小可分辨週期，與 λ/(2NA) 比較；再沿 z 軸以 50 nm 步進掃描同一顆珠，量軸向強度分佈的半高寬，核對是否接近 n·λ/NA² 的預測，偏大表示實際 NA 不足或存在球差。","textEn":"Measure the lateral PSF full width at half maximum and the smallest resolvable period with 100 nm fluorescent beads or a Siemens star target and compare with λ/(2NA); then scan the same bead along z in 50 nm steps, measure the axial intensity full width at half maximum and check it against the n·λ/NA² prediction, since a larger value indicates reduced effective NA or spherical aberration.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries\"?","options":["以 100 nm 螢光珠或 Siemens 星形靶量測橫向 PSF 半高寬與最小可分辨週期，與 λ/(2NA) 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the lateral PSF full width at half maximum and the smallest resolvable period with 100 nm fluorescent beads or a Siemens star target and compare with λ/(2NA).","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以 100 nm 螢光珠或 Siemens 星形靶量測橫向 PSF 半高寬與最小可分辨週期，與 λ/(2NA) 比較；再沿 z 軸以 50 nm 步進掃描同一顆珠，量軸向強度分佈的半高寬，核對是否接近 n·λ/NA² 的預測，偏大表示實際 NA 不足或存在球差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the lateral PSF full width at half maximum and the smallest resolvable period with 100 nm fluorescent beads or a Siemens star target and compare with λ/(2NA); then scan the same bead along z in 50 nm steps, measure the axial intensity full width at half maximum and check it against the n·λ/NA² prediction, since a larger value indicates reduced effective NA or spherical aberration. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a406-v12-04","title":"Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界：失效診斷","titleEn":"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「物鏡出瞳與數值孔徑」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Objective exit pupil and numerical aperture” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若浸油折射率與設計值不符或油膜中有氣泡，有效 NA 下降，橫向解析度從 196 nm 退化到 250 nm 以上，而物鏡本身並無缺陷，使用者卻以為物鏡不良。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the immersion oil index deviates from design or the oil film contains bubbles, the effective NA drops, lateral resolution degrades from 196 nm to above 250 nm, and the user blames an objective that is actually faultless. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：軸向解析度隨 NA 的平方改善，但景深也跟著縮到 1 µm 以下，於是任何波長之間的焦點差都必須小於景深，否則不同顏色的影像無法同時清晰；這正是複消色差物鏡存在的理由，色差規格要用景深為尺度來訂。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Axial resolution improves with the square of NA, but depth of field shrinks below 1 µm with it, so any focus difference between wavelengths must be smaller than that depth or the colours cannot be sharp simultaneously; this is exactly why apochromats exist, and chromatic specifications must be written in units of depth of field.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher magnification always means better resolution.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若浸油折射率與設計值不符或油膜中有氣泡，有效 NA 下降，橫向解析度從 196 nm 退化到 250 nm 以上，而物鏡本身並無缺陷，使用者卻以為物鏡不良。","textEn":"If the immersion oil index deviates from design or the oil film contains bubbles, the effective NA drops, lateral resolution degrades from 196 nm to above 250 nm, and the user blames an objective that is actually faultless.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Abbe 解析度與軸向景深的規格邊界」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Abbe resolution and axial depth as specification boundaries\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若浸油折射率與設計值不符或油膜中有氣泡，有效 NA 下降，橫向解析度從 196 nm 退化到 250 nm 以上，而物鏡本身並無缺陷，使用者卻以為物鏡不良。","只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If the immersion oil index deviates from design or the oil film contains bubbles, the effective NA drops, lateral resolution degrades from 196 nm to above 250 nm, and the user blames an objective that is actually faultless.","With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若浸油折射率與設計值不符或油膜中有氣泡，有效 NA 下降，橫向解析度從 196 nm 退化到 250 nm 以上，而物鏡本身並無缺陷，使用者卻以為物鏡不良。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the immersion oil index deviates from design or the oil film contains bubbles, the effective NA drops, lateral resolution degrades from 196 nm to above 250 nm, and the user blames an objective that is actually faultless. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a406-v12-05","title":"二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「部分色散圖與二級光譜」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"消色差雙合鏡只能讓兩個波長（F 與 C 線）共焦，其餘波長的焦點偏離稱為二級光譜，大小由兩種玻璃的部分色散差 ΔP 與 Abbe 數差 Δν 的比值決定。普通玻璃的部分色散幾乎落在一條直線上，所以 ΔP/Δν 幾乎是常數，無法用普通玻璃消除；只有螢石、氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃或特殊短火石這類偏離正常線的材料，才能讓三個波長共焦並同時校正球差，這就是複消色差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「部分色散圖與二級光譜」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An achromatic doublet brings only two wavelengths (the F and C lines) to a common focus; the residual focus error of other wavelengths is the secondary spectrum, whose size is set by the ratio of the partial-dispersion difference ΔP to the Abbe-number difference Δν of the two glasses. Ordinary glasses have partial dispersions lying almost on a straight line, so ΔP/Δν is nearly constant and cannot be cancelled with ordinary glasses; only materials off the normal line such as fluorite, fluorophosphate crowns or special short flints allow three wavelengths to share a focus while spherical aberration is also corrected, which is the apochromatic condition. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：二級光譜 Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Secondary spectrum Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「部分色散圖與二級光譜」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-05-k1","title":"二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件","titleEn":"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition","text":"消色差雙合鏡只能讓兩個波長（F 與 C 線）共焦，其餘波長的焦點偏離稱為二級光譜，大小由兩種玻璃的部分色散差 ΔP 與 Abbe 數差 Δν 的比值決定。普通玻璃的部分色散幾乎落在一條直線上，所以 ΔP/Δν 幾乎是常數，無法用普通玻璃消除；只有螢石、氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃或特殊短火石這類偏離正常線的材料，才能讓三個波長共焦並同時校正球差，這就是複消色差。","textEn":"An achromatic doublet brings only two wavelengths (the F and C lines) to a common focus; the residual focus error of other wavelengths is the secondary spectrum, whose size is set by the ratio of the partial-dispersion difference ΔP to the Abbe-number difference Δν of the two glasses. Ordinary glasses have partial dispersions lying almost on a straight line, so ΔP/Δν is nearly constant and cannot be cancelled with ordinary glasses; only materials off the normal line such as fluorite, fluorophosphate crowns or special short flints allow three wavelengths to share a focus while spherical aberration is also corrected, which is the apochromatic condition.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition\" is correct?","options":["只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。","消色差雙合鏡只能讓兩個波長（F 與 C 線）共焦，其餘波長的焦點偏離稱為二級光譜，大小由兩種玻璃的部分色散差 ΔP 與 Abbe 數差 Δν 的比值決定。"],"optionsEn":["With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum.","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.","An achromatic doublet brings only two wavelengths (the F and C lines) to a common focus."],"answer":2,"explanation":"消色差雙合鏡只能讓兩個波長（F 與 C 線）共焦，其餘波長的焦點偏離稱為二級光譜，大小由兩種玻璃的部分色散差 ΔP 與 Abbe 數差 Δν 的比值決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An achromatic doublet brings only two wavelengths (the F and C lines) to a common focus; the residual focus error of other wavelengths is the secondary spectrum, whose size is set by the ratio of the partial-dispersion difference ΔP to the Abbe-number difference Δν of the two glasses. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a406-v12-06","title":"二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件：定量估算","titleEn":"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「部分色散圖與二級光譜」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：二級光譜 Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂)。N-BK7（ν = 64.2，P_gF = 0.535）與 F2（ν = 36.4，P_gF = 0.583）：ΔP/Δν = −0.048/27.8 ≈ −1.7×10⁻³，即 f/580；物鏡焦距 f = 2 mm 時 g 線焦點偏離 3.4 µm，是 0.43 µm 景深的 8 倍。改用匹配的異常色散對（ΔP ≈ 0.004、Δν ≈ 50）得 8×10⁻⁵，即 f/12500，殘差 0.16 µm，小於景深。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Secondary spectrum Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂). For N-BK7 (ν = 64.2, P_gF = 0.535) with F2 (ν = 36.4, P_gF = 0.583), ΔP/Δν = −0.048/27.8 ≈ −1.7×10⁻³, i.e. f/580; for an objective focal length f = 2 mm the g-line focus is off by 3.4 µm, 8 times the 0.43 µm depth of field. A matched anomalous-dispersion pair (ΔP ≈ 0.004, Δν ≈ 50) gives 8×10⁻⁵, i.e. f/12500, a residual of 0.16 µm, below the depth of field. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用 405、488、561 與 640 nm 的雷射線或窄帶濾光片依序對同一顆次解析螢光珠找最佳焦面，記錄各波長的 z 位置差；把焦點差畫成波長的函數，與設計軟體輸出的軸向色差曲線比較，並確認最大偏差落在景深之內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Find the best focus of the same sub-resolution fluorescent bead at 405, 488, 561 and 640 nm using laser lines or narrowband filters and record the z position for each wavelength; plot the focus difference against wavelength, compare with the axial chromatic curve from the design software and confirm the largest deviation lies within the depth of field.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"二級光譜 Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂)。N-BK7（ν = 64.2，P_gF = 0.535）與 F2（ν = 36.4，P_gF = 0.583）：ΔP/Δν = −0.048/27.8 ≈ −1.7×10⁻³，即 f/580；物鏡焦距 f = 2 mm 時 g 線焦點偏離 3.4 µm，是 0.43 µm 景深的 8 倍。改用匹配的異常色散對（ΔP ≈ 0.004、Δν ≈ 50）得 8×10⁻⁵，即 f/12500，殘差 0.16 µm，小於景深。","textEn":"Secondary spectrum Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂). For N-BK7 (ν = 64.2, P_gF = 0.535) with F2 (ν = 36.4, P_gF = 0.583), ΔP/Δν = −0.048/27.8 ≈ −1.7×10⁻³, i.e. f/580; for an objective focal length f = 2 mm the g-line focus is off by 3.4 µm, 8 times the 0.43 µm depth of field. A matched anomalous-dispersion pair (ΔP ≈ 0.004, Δν ≈ 50) gives 8×10⁻⁵, i.e. f/12500, a residual of 0.16 µm, below the depth of field.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition\", which statement holds?","options":["二級光譜 Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂)。","量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。","物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。"],"optionsEn":["Secondary spectrum Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂).","A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat.","The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope."],"answer":0,"explanation":"二級光譜 Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Secondary spectrum Δf_g ≈ f·(P₁ − P₂)/(ν₁ − ν₂). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a406-v12-07","title":"二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「部分色散圖與二級光譜」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用 405、488、561 與 640 nm 的雷射線或窄帶濾光片依序對同一顆次解析螢光珠找最佳焦面，記錄各波長的 z 位置差；把焦點差畫成波長的函數，與設計軟體輸出的軸向色差曲線比較，並確認最大偏差落在景深之內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Find the best focus of the same sub-resolution fluorescent bead at 405, 488, 561 and 640 nm using laser lines or narrowband filters and record the z position for each wavelength; plot the focus difference against wavelength, compare with the axial chromatic curve from the design software and confirm the largest deviation lies within the depth of field. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若量產時把一片氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃替換成部分色散不同的替代牌號，三個波長的共焦條件被破壞，紅與藍通道的影像平面相差超過 1 µm，多色共定位實驗出現假性的空間分離。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If production substitutes a fluorophosphate crown with an alternative grade of different partial dispersion, the three-wavelength common focus is lost, red and blue image planes separate by more than 1 µm, and multicolour colocalisation experiments show false spatial separation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用 405、488、561 與 640 nm 的雷射線或窄帶濾光片依序對同一顆次解析螢光珠找最佳焦面，記錄各波長的 z 位置差；把焦點差畫成波長的函數，與設計軟體輸出的軸向色差曲線比較，並確認最大偏差落在景深之內。","textEn":"Find the best focus of the same sub-resolution fluorescent bead at 405, 488, 561 and 640 nm using laser lines or narrowband filters and record the z position for each wavelength; plot the focus difference against wavelength, compare with the axial chromatic curve from the design software and confirm the largest deviation lies within the depth of field.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","用 405、488、561 與 640 nm 的雷射線或窄帶濾光片依序對同一顆次解析螢光珠找最佳焦面，記錄各波長的 z 位置差。","物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Find the best focus of the same sub-resolution fluorescent bead at 405, 488, 561 and 640 nm using laser lines or narrowband filters and record the z position for each wavelength.","An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用 405、488、561 與 640 nm 的雷射線或窄帶濾光片依序對同一顆次解析螢光珠找最佳焦面，記錄各波長的 z 位置差；把焦點差畫成波長的函數，與設計軟體輸出的軸向色差曲線比較，並確認最大偏差落在景深之內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Find the best focus of the same sub-resolution fluorescent bead at 405, 488, 561 and 640 nm using laser lines or narrowband filters and record the z position for each wavelength; plot the focus difference against wavelength, compare with the axial chromatic curve from the design software and confirm the largest deviation lies within the depth of field. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a406-v12-08","title":"二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件：失效診斷","titleEn":"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「部分色散圖與二級光譜」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Partial-dispersion diagram and secondary spectrum” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若量產時把一片氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃替換成部分色散不同的替代牌號，三個波長的共焦條件被破壞，紅與藍通道的影像平面相差超過 1 µm，多色共定位實驗出現假性的空間分離。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If production substitutes a fluorophosphate crown with an alternative grade of different partial dispersion, the three-wavelength common focus is lost, red and blue image planes separate by more than 1 µm, and multicolour colocalisation experiments show false spatial separation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：普通玻璃的部分色散幾乎落在一條直線上，所以 ΔP/Δν 幾乎是常數，無法用普通玻璃消除；只有螢石、氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃或特殊短火石這類偏離正常線的材料，才能讓三個波長共焦並同時校正球差，這就是複消色差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ordinary glasses have partial dispersions lying almost on a straight line, so ΔP/Δν is nearly constant and cannot be cancelled with ordinary glasses; only materials off the normal line such as fluorite, fluorophosphate crowns or special short flints allow three wavelengths to share a focus while spherical aberration is also corrected, which is the apochromatic condition.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若量產時把一片氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃替換成部分色散不同的替代牌號，三個波長的共焦條件被破壞，紅與藍通道的影像平面相差超過 1 µm，多色共定位實驗出現假性的空間分離。","textEn":"If production substitutes a fluorophosphate crown with an alternative grade of different partial dispersion, the three-wavelength common focus is lost, red and blue image planes separate by more than 1 µm, and multicolour colocalisation experiments show false spatial separation.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「二級光譜、部分色散與複消色差條件」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Secondary spectrum, partial dispersion and the apochromatic condition\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。","若量產時把一片氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃替換成部分色散不同的替代牌號，三個波長的共焦條件被破壞，紅與藍通道的影像平面相差超過 1 µm，多色共定位實驗出現假性的空間分離。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.","If production substitutes a fluorophosphate crown with an alternative grade of different partial dispersion, the three-wavelength common focus is lost, red and blue image planes separate by more than 1 µm, and multicolour colocalisation experiments show false spatial separation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若量產時把一片氟磷酸鹽冕玻璃替換成部分色散不同的替代牌號，三個波長的共焦條件被破壞，紅與藍通道的影像平面相差超過 1 µm，多色共定位實驗出現假性的空間分離。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If production substitutes a fluorophosphate crown with an alternative grade of different partial dispersion, the three-wavelength common focus is lost, red and blue image planes separate by more than 1 µm, and multicolour colocalisation experiments show false spatial separation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a406-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低」與「鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction\" and \"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a406-v12-09","title":"齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「齊明半球前鏡組」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Aplanatic hemispherical front group” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"高 NA 物鏡的前端是一片半球或超半球透鏡，試樣與浸油的折射率相近，試樣位於球面的齊明點（距球心 R/n）時，球面既不產生球差也不產生彗差，但把光線的正弦角度除以 n，再接一片齊明彎月鏡可以再除一次。這樣把 NA 1.4 的陡峭光束降成後方鏡組容易處理的角度，之後的螢石與異常色散玻璃雙合、三合鏡才負責色差與剩餘球差的校正。螢石（CaF₂）的 Abbe 數約 95，但質地軟且易受熱衝擊，加工與鍍膜都需特別處理。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「齊明半球前鏡組」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The front of a high-NA objective is a hemispherical or hyper-hemispherical lens; with specimen and immersion oil of nearly equal index, a specimen at the aplanatic point of the sphere (R/n from the centre) sees neither spherical aberration nor coma, while the sine of the ray angle is divided by n, and a following aplanatic meniscus divides it once more. This reduces the steep NA 1.4 beam to angles the rear groups can handle, after which fluorite and anomalous-dispersion doublets and triplets correct colour and residual spherical aberration. Fluorite (CaF₂) has an Abbe number near 95 but is soft and sensitive to thermal shock, so it needs special handling in polishing and coating. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Aplanatic hemispherical front group”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：油中邊緣光 sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924（u ≈ 67.5°）；經第一齊明面後 sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610（37.6°），第二齊明彎月鏡後 0.610/1.515 = 0.403（23.7°），相當於後鏡組只需處理 NA 0.4 的光束。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The marginal ray in oil has sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924 (u ≈ 67.5°); after the first aplanatic surface sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610 (37.6°), and after the second aplanatic meniscus 0.610/1.515 = 0.403 (23.7°), so the rear groups handle only an NA 0.4 beam.","failure":"常見誤解：「螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「齊明半球前鏡組」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Aplanatic hemispherical front group”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-09-k1","title":"齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低","titleEn":"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction","text":"高 NA 物鏡的前端是一片半球或超半球透鏡，試樣與浸油的折射率相近，試樣位於球面的齊明點（距球心 R/n）時，球面既不產生球差也不產生彗差，但把光線的正弦角度除以 n，再接一片齊明彎月鏡可以再除一次。這樣把 NA 1.4 的陡峭光束降成後方鏡組容易處理的角度，之後的螢石與異常色散玻璃雙合、三合鏡才負責色差與剩餘球差的校正。","textEn":"The front of a high-NA objective is a hemispherical or hyper-hemispherical lens; with specimen and immersion oil of nearly equal index, a specimen at the aplanatic point of the sphere (R/n from the centre) sees neither spherical aberration nor coma, while the sine of the ray angle is divided by n, and a following aplanatic meniscus divides it once more. This reduces the steep NA 1.4 beam to angles the rear groups can handle, after which fluorite and anomalous-dispersion doublets and triplets correct colour and residual spherical aberration.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction\" is correct?","options":["高 NA 物鏡的前端是一片半球或超半球透鏡，試樣與浸油的折射率相近，試樣位於球面的齊明點（距球心 R/n）時，球面既不產生球差也不產生彗差，但把光線的正弦角度除以 n，再接一片齊明彎月鏡可以再除一次。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。","鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["The front of a high-NA objective is a hemispherical or hyper-hemispherical lens.","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.","A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"高 NA 物鏡的前端是一片半球或超半球透鏡，試樣與浸油的折射率相近，試樣位於球面的齊明點（距球心 R/n）時，球面既不產生球差也不產生彗差，但把光線的正弦角度除以 n，再接一片齊明彎月鏡可以再除一次。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The front of a high-NA objective is a hemispherical or hyper-hemispherical lens; with specimen and immersion oil of nearly equal index, a specimen at the aplanatic point of the sphere (R/n from the centre) sees neither spherical aberration nor coma, while the sine of the ray angle is divided by n, and a following aplanatic meniscus divides it once more. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a406-v12-10","title":"齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低：定量估算","titleEn":"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「齊明半球前鏡組」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Aplanatic hemispherical front group” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：油中邊緣光 sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924（u ≈ 67.5°）；經第一齊明面後 sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610（37.6°），第二齊明彎月鏡後 0.610/1.515 = 0.403（23.7°），相當於後鏡組只需處理 NA 0.4 的光束。每個齊明面的橫向放大率為 n² ≈ 2.3，兩面合計約 5.3 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The marginal ray in oil has sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924 (u ≈ 67.5°); after the first aplanatic surface sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610 (37.6°), and after the second aplanatic meniscus 0.610/1.515 = 0.403 (23.7°), so the rear groups handle only an NA 0.4 beam. Each aplanatic surface magnifies by n² ≈ 2.3, about 5.3× for the two together. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用設計軟體追跡邊緣光線，核對每個齊明面前後的 sinu 比值是否等於折射率，並確認前鏡組單獨的球差與彗差係數接近零；實物上以干涉儀對前鏡組做局部波前測試，比較量測的球差項與設計殘差，差異反映曲率半徑或中心厚度的加工偏差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Trace the marginal ray in design software and check that the ratio of sinu before and after each aplanatic surface equals the refractive index, confirming that the front group alone has near-zero spherical and coma coefficients; on hardware, test the front group's wavefront interferometrically and compare the measured spherical term with the design residual, since any difference reflects fabrication errors in radius or centre thickness.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"油中邊緣光 sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924（u ≈ 67.5°）；經第一齊明面後 sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610（37.6°），第二齊明彎月鏡後 0.610/1.515 = 0.403（23.7°），相當於後鏡組只需處理 NA 0.4 的光束。每個齊明面的橫向放大率為 n² ≈ 2.3，兩面合計約 5.3 倍。","textEn":"The marginal ray in oil has sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924 (u ≈ 67.5°); after the first aplanatic surface sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610 (37.6°), and after the second aplanatic meniscus 0.610/1.515 = 0.403 (23.7°), so the rear groups handle only an NA 0.4 beam. Each aplanatic surface magnifies by n² ≈ 2.3, about 5.3× for the two together.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction\", which statement holds?","options":["油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。","油中邊緣光 sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924（u ≈ 67.5°）。","物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。"],"optionsEn":["Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.","The marginal ray in oil has sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924 (u ≈ 67.5°).","An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"油中邊緣光 sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924（u ≈ 67.5°）；經第一齊明面後 sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610（37.6°），第二齊明彎月鏡後 0.610/1.515 = 0.403（23.7°），相當於後鏡組只需處理 NA 0.4 的光束。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The marginal ray in oil has sinu = 1.4/1.515 = 0.924 (u ≈ 67.5°); after the first aplanatic surface sinu' = 0.924/1.515 = 0.610 (37.6°), and after the second aplanatic meniscus 0.610/1.515 = 0.403 (23.7°), so the rear groups handle only an NA 0.4 beam. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a406-v12-11","title":"齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「齊明半球前鏡組」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Aplanatic hemispherical front group” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用設計軟體追跡邊緣光線，核對每個齊明面前後的 sinu 比值是否等於折射率，並確認前鏡組單獨的球差與彗差係數接近零；實物上以干涉儀對前鏡組做局部波前測試，比較量測的球差項與設計殘差，差異反映曲率半徑或中心厚度的加工偏差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Trace the marginal ray in design software and check that the ratio of sinu before and after each aplanatic surface equals the refractive index, confirming that the front group alone has near-zero spherical and coma coefficients; on hardware, test the front group's wavefront interferometrically and compare the measured spherical term with the design residual, since any difference reflects fabrication errors in radius or centre thickness. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：半球前鏡的中心厚度若比設計厚 20 µm，齊明點位置偏移，球差與彗差同時出現，無法靠校正環完全補償，整支物鏡的 Strehl 在最佳焦面也降到 0.8 以下。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the hemispherical front lens is 20 µm thicker than design, the aplanatic point shifts, spherical aberration and coma appear together, the correction collar cannot fully compensate, and the whole objective's Strehl falls below 0.8 even at best focus.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用設計軟體追跡邊緣光線，核對每個齊明面前後的 sinu 比值是否等於折射率，並確認前鏡組單獨的球差與彗差係數接近零；實物上以干涉儀對前鏡組做局部波前測試，比較量測的球差項與設計殘差，差異反映曲率半徑或中心厚度的加工偏差。","textEn":"Trace the marginal ray in design software and check that the ratio of sinu before and after each aplanatic surface equals the refractive index, confirming that the front group alone has near-zero spherical and coma coefficients; on hardware, test the front group's wavefront interferometrically and compare the measured spherical term with the design residual, since any difference reflects fabrication errors in radius or centre thickness.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","用設計軟體追跡邊緣光線，核對每個齊明面前後的 sinu 比值是否等於折射率，並確認前鏡組單獨的球差與彗差係數接近零。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Higher magnification always means better resolution.","Trace the marginal ray in design software and check that the ratio of sinu before and after each aplanatic surface equals the refractive index, confirming that the front group alone has near-zero spherical and coma coefficients."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用設計軟體追跡邊緣光線，核對每個齊明面前後的 sinu 比值是否等於折射率，並確認前鏡組單獨的球差與彗差係數接近零；實物上以干涉儀對前鏡組做局部波前測試，比較量測的球差項與設計殘差，差異反映曲率半徑或中心厚度的加工偏差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Trace the marginal ray in design software and check that the ratio of sinu before and after each aplanatic surface equals the refractive index, confirming that the front group alone has near-zero spherical and coma coefficients; on hardware, test the front group's wavefront interferometrically and compare the measured spherical term with the design residual, since any difference reflects fabrication errors in radius or centre thickness. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a406-v12-12","title":"齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低：失效診斷","titleEn":"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「齊明半球前鏡組」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Aplanatic hemispherical front group” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"半球前鏡的中心厚度若比設計厚 20 µm，齊明點位置偏移，球差與彗差同時出現，無法靠校正環完全補償，整支物鏡的 Strehl 在最佳焦面也降到 0.8 以下。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the hemispherical front lens is 20 µm thicker than design, the aplanatic point shifts, spherical aberration and coma appear together, the correction collar cannot fully compensate, and the whole objective's Strehl falls below 0.8 even at best focus. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：螢石（CaF₂）的 Abbe 數約 95，但質地軟且易受熱衝擊，加工與鍍膜都需特別處理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Fluorite (CaF₂) has an Abbe number near 95 but is soft and sensitive to thermal shock, so it needs special handling in polishing and coating.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"半球前鏡的中心厚度若比設計厚 20 µm，齊明點位置偏移，球差與彗差同時出現，無法靠校正環完全補償，整支物鏡的 Strehl 在最佳焦面也降到 0.8 以下。","textEn":"If the hemispherical front lens is 20 µm thicker than design, the aplanatic point shifts, spherical aberration and coma appear together, the correction collar cannot fully compensate, and the whole objective's Strehl falls below 0.8 even at best focus.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「齊明面、螢石材料與光線角的逐級降低」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Aplanatic surfaces, fluorite materials and stepwise angle reduction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["半球前鏡的中心厚度若比設計厚 20 µm，齊明點位置偏移，球差與彗差同時出現，無法靠校正環完全補償，整支物鏡的 Strehl 在最佳焦面也降到 0.8 以下。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["If the hemispherical front lens is 20 µm thicker than design, the aplanatic point shifts, spherical aberration and coma appear together, the correction collar cannot fully compensate, and the whole objective's Strehl falls below 0.8 even at best focus.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible."],"answer":0,"explanation":"半球前鏡的中心厚度若比設計厚 20 µm，齊明點位置偏移，球差與彗差同時出現，無法靠校正環完全補償，整支物鏡的 Strehl 在最佳焦面也降到 0.8 以下。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the hemispherical front lens is 20 µm thicker than design, the aplanatic point shifts, spherical aberration and coma appear together, the correction collar cannot fully compensate, and the whole objective's Strehl falls below 0.8 even at best focus. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a406-v12-13","title":"鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"一支複消色差物鏡通常有 10 到 15 片鏡片，其中多組膠合；每片的曲率、厚度與折射率誤差都會改變色差與球差的平衡，所以組裝時以空氣間隙或選配鏡片作為補償項。鏡片對心是最敏感的公差：偏心產生與視場無關的彗差，用對心儀以反射像判定光軸後再修邊與膠合。每個玻璃空氣界面都要鍍寬頻增透膜，否則 30 個界面的反射損失會讓透過率與對比同時崩潰。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An apochromat typically has 10 to 15 elements, several cemented; errors in radius, thickness and refractive index of every element shift the balance of chromatic and spherical correction, so an air gap or selected elements serve as compensators during assembly. Centring is the most sensitive tolerance: decentration produces field-independent coma, so each element's optical axis is located with a centring instrument from reflected images before edging and cementing. Every glass-air interface needs a broadband antireflection coating, otherwise the reflection losses of 30 interfaces collapse both transmission and contrast. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若某片鏡片的彗差靈敏度為 0.05 波/µm 偏心，2 µm 偏心產生 0.1 波（550 nm 下 55 nm）的彗差，超過 Maréchal 判據 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm，因此偏心必須控制在約 1 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If an element's coma sensitivity is 0.05 waves per µm of decentration, 2 µm produces 0.1 waves (55 nm at 550 nm) of coma, beyond the Maréchal criterion λ/14 ≈ 39 nm, so decentration must be held to about 1 µm.","failure":"常見誤解：「鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-13-k1","title":"鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜","titleEn":"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings","text":"一支複消色差物鏡通常有 10 到 15 片鏡片，其中多組膠合；每片的曲率、厚度與折射率誤差都會改變色差與球差的平衡，所以組裝時以空氣間隙或選配鏡片作為補償項。鏡片對心是最敏感的公差：偏心產生與視場無關的彗差，用對心儀以反射像判定光軸後再修邊與膠合。","textEn":"An apochromat typically has 10 to 15 elements, several cemented; errors in radius, thickness and refractive index of every element shift the balance of chromatic and spherical correction, so an air gap or selected elements serve as compensators during assembly. Centring is the most sensitive tolerance: decentration produces field-independent coma, so each element's optical axis is located with a centring instrument from reflected images before edging and cementing.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings\" is correct?","options":["鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。","一支複消色差物鏡通常有 10 到 15 片鏡片，其中多組膠合；每片的曲率、厚度與折射率誤差都會改變色差與球差的平衡，所以組裝時以空氣間隙或選配鏡片作為補償項。","量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。"],"optionsEn":["A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.","An apochromat typically has 10 to 15 elements, several cemented.","A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat."],"answer":1,"explanation":"一支複消色差物鏡通常有 10 到 15 片鏡片，其中多組膠合；每片的曲率、厚度與折射率誤差都會改變色差與球差的平衡，所以組裝時以空氣間隙或選配鏡片作為補償項。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An apochromat typically has 10 to 15 elements, several cemented; errors in radius, thickness and refractive index of every element shift the balance of chromatic and spherical correction, so an air gap or selected elements serve as compensators during assembly. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a406-v12-14","title":"鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜：定量估算","titleEn":"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若某片鏡片的彗差靈敏度為 0.05 波/µm 偏心，2 µm 偏心產生 0.1 波（550 nm 下 55 nm）的彗差，超過 Maréchal 判據 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm，因此偏心必須控制在約 1 µm。透過率：30 個界面各反射 0.3% 時 T = 0.997³⁰ ≈ 0.91；若未鍍膜各反射 4%，T = 0.96³⁰ ≈ 0.29。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If an element's coma sensitivity is 0.05 waves per µm of decentration, 2 µm produces 0.1 waves (55 nm at 550 nm) of coma, beyond the Maréchal criterion λ/14 ≈ 39 nm, so decentration must be held to about 1 µm. Transmission: 30 interfaces at 0.3% reflection each give T = 0.997³⁰ ≈ 0.91; uncoated at 4% each, T = 0.96³⁰ ≈ 0.29. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：組裝後以星點測試或干涉儀量軸上波前，彗差項若大於預算就依靈敏度表反推是哪一組偏心並重新對心；用分光光度計量整支物鏡 400 到 700 nm 的透過率曲線，與各界面鍍膜反射率的乘積模型比較，差異大於 3% 表示某層膜或膠合層有問題。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After assembly measure the on-axis wavefront with a star test or interferometer; if the coma term exceeds budget, use the sensitivity table to identify which group is decentred and re-centre it.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若某片鏡片的彗差靈敏度為 0.05 波/µm 偏心，2 µm 偏心產生 0.1 波（550 nm 下 55 nm）的彗差，超過 Maréchal 判據 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm，因此偏心必須控制在約 1 µm。透過率：30 個界面各反射 0.3% 時 T = 0.997³⁰ ≈ 0.91；若未鍍膜各反射 4%，T = 0.96³⁰ ≈ 0.29。","textEn":"If an element's coma sensitivity is 0.05 waves per µm of decentration, 2 µm produces 0.1 waves (55 nm at 550 nm) of coma, beyond the Maréchal criterion λ/14 ≈ 39 nm, so decentration must be held to about 1 µm. Transmission: 30 interfaces at 0.3% reflection each give T = 0.997³⁰ ≈ 0.91; uncoated at 4% each, T = 0.96³⁰ ≈ 0.29.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings\", which statement holds?","options":["物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。","放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","若某片鏡片的彗差靈敏度為 0.05 波/µm 偏心，2 µm 偏心產生 0.1 波（550 nm 下 55 nm）的彗差，超過 Maréchal 判據 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm，因此偏心必須控制在約 1 µm。"],"optionsEn":["The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope.","Higher magnification always means better resolution.","If an element's coma sensitivity is 0.05 waves per µm of decentration, 2 µm produces 0.1 waves (55 nm at 550 nm) of coma, beyond the Maréchal criterion λ/14 ≈ 39 nm, so decentration must be held to about 1 µm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若某片鏡片的彗差靈敏度為 0.05 波/µm 偏心，2 µm 偏心產生 0.1 波（550 nm 下 55 nm）的彗差，超過 Maréchal 判據 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm，因此偏心必須控制在約 1 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If an element's coma sensitivity is 0.05 waves per µm of decentration, 2 µm produces 0.1 waves (55 nm at 550 nm) of coma, beyond the Maréchal criterion λ/14 ≈ 39 nm, so decentration must be held to about 1 µm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a406-v12-15","title":"鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"組裝後以星點測試或干涉儀量軸上波前，彗差項若大於預算就依靈敏度表反推是哪一組偏心並重新對心；用分光光度計量整支物鏡 400 到 700 nm 的透過率曲線，與各界面鍍膜反射率的乘積模型比較，差異大於 3% 表示某層膜或膠合層有問題。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After assembly measure the on-axis wavefront with a star test or interferometer; if the coma term exceeds budget, use the sensitivity table to identify which group is decentred and re-centre it. Measure the full objective's transmission from 400 to 700 nm with a spectrophotometer and compare with the product model of the interface reflectances, where a discrepancy above 3% points to a faulty coating or cement layer. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：膠合層固化時收縮不均會把一組鏡片拉偏數微米，物鏡在出廠測試合格，但經過幾個月的熱循環後彗差逐漸浮現，影像在整個視場出現同方向的彗星尾。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Uneven shrinkage of a cement layer during curing can pull a cemented group several micrometres off centre; the objective passes the factory test, but after months of thermal cycling coma gradually emerges and every point in the field shows a comet tail in the same direction.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"組裝後以星點測試或干涉儀量軸上波前，彗差項若大於預算就依靈敏度表反推是哪一組偏心並重新對心；用分光光度計量整支物鏡 400 到 700 nm 的透過率曲線，與各界面鍍膜反射率的乘積模型比較，差異大於 3% 表示某層膜或膠合層有問題。","textEn":"After assembly measure the on-axis wavefront with a star test or interferometer; if the coma term exceeds budget, use the sensitivity table to identify which group is decentred and re-centre it. Measure the full objective's transmission from 400 to 700 nm with a spectrophotometer and compare with the product model of the interface reflectances, where a discrepancy above 3% points to a faulty coating or cement layer.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings\"?","options":["組裝後以星點測試或干涉儀量軸上波前，彗差項若大於預算就依靈敏度表反推是哪一組偏心並重新對心。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。"],"optionsEn":["After assembly measure the on-axis wavefront with a star test or interferometer.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum."],"answer":0,"explanation":"組裝後以星點測試或干涉儀量軸上波前，彗差項若大於預算就依靈敏度表反推是哪一組偏心並重新對心；用分光光度計量整支物鏡 400 到 700 nm 的透過率曲線，與各界面鍍膜反射率的乘積模型比較，差異大於 3% 表示某層膜或膠合層有問題。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"After assembly measure the on-axis wavefront with a star test or interferometer; if the coma term exceeds budget, use the sensitivity table to identify which group is decentred and re-centre it. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a406-v12-16","title":"鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜：失效診斷","titleEn":"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鏡片偏心公差與增透膜」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Element centring tolerance and antireflection coatings” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"膠合層固化時收縮不均會把一組鏡片拉偏數微米，物鏡在出廠測試合格，但經過幾個月的熱循環後彗差逐漸浮現，影像在整個視場出現同方向的彗星尾。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Uneven shrinkage of a cement layer during curing can pull a cemented group several micrometres off centre; the objective passes the factory test, but after months of thermal cycling coma gradually emerges and every point in the field shows a comet tail in the same direction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每個玻璃空氣界面都要鍍寬頻增透膜，否則 30 個界面的反射損失會讓透過率與對比同時崩潰。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Every glass-air interface needs a broadband antireflection coating, otherwise the reflection losses of 30 interfaces collapse both transmission and contrast.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"膠合層固化時收縮不均會把一組鏡片拉偏數微米，物鏡在出廠測試合格，但經過幾個月的熱循環後彗差逐漸浮現，影像在整個視場出現同方向的彗星尾。","textEn":"Uneven shrinkage of a cement layer during curing can pull a cemented group several micrometres off centre; the objective passes the factory test, but after months of thermal cycling coma gradually emerges and every point in the field shows a comet tail in the same direction.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鏡片製造、對心組裝與寬頻增透膜」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Element fabrication, centred assembly and broadband antireflection coatings\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","膠合層固化時收縮不均會把一組鏡片拉偏數微米，物鏡在出廠測試合格，但經過幾個月的熱循環後彗差逐漸浮現，影像在整個視場出現同方向的彗星尾。","量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Uneven shrinkage of a cement layer during curing can pull a cemented group several micrometres off centre.","A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat."],"answer":1,"explanation":"膠合層固化時收縮不均會把一組鏡片拉偏數微米，物鏡在出廠測試合格，但經過幾個月的熱循環後彗差逐漸浮現，影像在整個視場出現同方向的彗星尾。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Uneven shrinkage of a cement layer during curing can pull a cemented group several micrometres off centre; the objective passes the factory test, but after months of thermal cycling coma gradually emerges and every point in the field shows a comet tail in the same direction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a406-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測」與「蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour\" and \"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a406-v12-17","title":"PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「多波長 PSF 量測台」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"物鏡的最終品質以點擴散函數（PSF）衡量：用直徑遠小於解析度的螢光珠或針孔作為點光源，記錄三維影像堆疊，從中取橫向半高寬、軸向半高寬、對稱性與 Strehl 比。多波長量測則揭露軸向色差與橫向色差；干涉儀測試能給出 Zernike 係數，但需要與物鏡匹配的參考球面與浸液。量測時蓋玻片厚度、浸油折射率與溫度都必須和設計條件一致，否則量到的是測試條件的像差而非物鏡的像差。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「多波長 PSF 量測台」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An objective's final quality is judged by its point-spread function (PSF): a fluorescent bead or pinhole far smaller than the resolution serves as a point source, a three-dimensional image stack is recorded, and lateral and axial full widths at half maximum, symmetry and Strehl ratio are extracted. Multi-wavelength measurement exposes axial and lateral colour; interferometric testing gives Zernike coefficients but needs a matched reference sphere and immersion. Cover-glass thickness, oil index and temperature during the test must match the design conditions, otherwise the measured aberration belongs to the test setup rather than to the objective. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：NA 1.4 在 520 nm 的理想橫向 PSF 半高寬 ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm；若量到 215 nm，相當於有效 NA 降到 1.23 或存在像差。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The ideal lateral PSF full width at half maximum at NA 1.4 and 520 nm is ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm; a measured 215 nm corresponds to an effective NA of 1.23 or to aberration.","failure":"常見誤解：「量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「多波長 PSF 量測台」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-17-k1","title":"PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測","titleEn":"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour","text":"物鏡的最終品質以點擴散函數（PSF）衡量：用直徑遠小於解析度的螢光珠或針孔作為點光源，記錄三維影像堆疊，從中取橫向半高寬、軸向半高寬、對稱性與 Strehl 比。多波長量測則揭露軸向色差與橫向色差；干涉儀測試能給出 Zernike 係數，但需要與物鏡匹配的參考球面與浸液。","textEn":"An objective's final quality is judged by its point-spread function (PSF): a fluorescent bead or pinhole far smaller than the resolution serves as a point source, a three-dimensional image stack is recorded, and lateral and axial full widths at half maximum, symmetry and Strehl ratio are extracted. Multi-wavelength measurement exposes axial and lateral colour; interferometric testing gives Zernike coefficients but needs a matched reference sphere and immersion.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour\" is correct?","options":["量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。","油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。","物鏡的最終品質以點擴散函數（PSF）衡量：用直徑遠小於解析度的螢光珠或針孔作為點光源，記錄三維影像堆疊，從中取橫向半高寬、軸向半高寬、對稱性與 Strehl 比。"],"optionsEn":["A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat.","Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.","An objective's final quality is judged by its point-spread function (PSF): a fluorescent bead or pinhole far smaller than the resolution serves as a point source, a three-dimensional image stack is recorded, and lateral and axial full widths at half maximum, symmetry and Strehl ratio are extracted."],"answer":2,"explanation":"物鏡的最終品質以點擴散函數（PSF）衡量：用直徑遠小於解析度的螢光珠或針孔作為點光源，記錄三維影像堆疊，從中取橫向半高寬、軸向半高寬、對稱性與 Strehl 比。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An objective's final quality is judged by its point-spread function (PSF): a fluorescent bead or pinhole far smaller than the resolution serves as a point source, a three-dimensional image stack is recorded, and lateral and axial full widths at half maximum, symmetry and Strehl ratio are extracted. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a406-v12-18","title":"PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「多波長 PSF 量測台」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：NA 1.4 在 520 nm 的理想橫向 PSF 半高寬 ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm；若量到 215 nm，相當於有效 NA 降到 1.23 或存在像差。Strehl 由 RMS 波前估計：σ = 30 nm 時 Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×30/550)²] = exp(−0.117) ≈ 0.89；σ = 45 nm 時約 0.77，已低於 0.8。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The ideal lateral PSF full width at half maximum at NA 1.4 and 520 nm is ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm; a measured 215 nm corresponds to an effective NA of 1.23 or to aberration. Strehl is estimated from RMS wavefront: for σ = 30 nm, Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×30/550)²] = exp(−0.117) ≈ 0.89; for σ = 45 nm about 0.77, already below 0.8. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以同一批 100 nm 珠在至少三個波長各取 10 顆珠的 PSF，計算半高寬平均與標準差，排除珠子大小的貢獻（以 √(FWHM² − d²) 近似去卷積）；把量測的 PSF 與由設計 Zernike 係數模擬的 PSF 比較，兩者半高寬差異應在 5% 內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Acquire PSFs of at least 10 beads from the same 100 nm batch at three or more wavelengths, compute the mean and standard deviation of the widths and remove the bead-size contribution with the approximation √(FWHM² − d²); compare the measured PSF with the PSF simulated from the design Zernike coefficients, where the widths should agree within 5%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"NA 1.4 在 520 nm 的理想橫向 PSF 半高寬 ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm；若量到 215 nm，相當於有效 NA 降到 1.23 或存在像差。Strehl 由 RMS 波前估計：σ = 30 nm 時 Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×30/550)²] = exp(−0.117) ≈ 0.89；σ = 45 nm 時約 0.77，已低於 0.8。","textEn":"The ideal lateral PSF full width at half maximum at NA 1.4 and 520 nm is ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm; a measured 215 nm corresponds to an effective NA of 1.23 or to aberration. Strehl is estimated from RMS wavefront: for σ = 30 nm, Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×30/550)²] = exp(−0.117) ≈ 0.89; for σ = 45 nm about 0.77, already below 0.8.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour\", which statement holds?","options":["NA 1.4 在 520 nm 的理想橫向 PSF 半高寬 ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm。","物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。","只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。"],"optionsEn":["The ideal lateral PSF full width at half maximum at NA 1.4 and 520 nm is ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm.","An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions.","With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum."],"answer":0,"explanation":"NA 1.4 在 520 nm 的理想橫向 PSF 半高寬 ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm；若量到 215 nm，相當於有效 NA 降到 1.23 或存在像差。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The ideal lateral PSF full width at half maximum at NA 1.4 and 520 nm is ≈ 0.51λ/NA = 0.51×520/1.4 ≈ 189 nm; a measured 215 nm corresponds to an effective NA of 1.23 or to aberration. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a406-v12-19","title":"PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「多波長 PSF 量測台」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以同一批 100 nm 珠在至少三個波長各取 10 顆珠的 PSF，計算半高寬平均與標準差，排除珠子大小的貢獻（以 √(FWHM² − d²) 近似去卷積）；把量測的 PSF 與由設計 Zernike 係數模擬的 PSF 比較，兩者半高寬差異應在 5% 內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Acquire PSFs of at least 10 beads from the same 100 nm batch at three or more wavelengths, compute the mean and standard deviation of the widths and remove the bead-size contribution with the approximation √(FWHM² − d²); compare the measured PSF with the PSF simulated from the design Zernike coefficients, where the widths should agree within 5%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若用厚度 150 µm 的蓋玻片測試設計給 170 µm 的物鏡，球差讓軸向 PSF 不對稱並拉長 50% 以上，測試報告判定物鏡不良，實際上是測試條件錯誤。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Testing an objective designed for a 170 µm cover glass with a 150 µm one introduces spherical aberration that makes the axial PSF asymmetric and over 50% longer, so the report condemns a good objective when the test condition was wrong.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以同一批 100 nm 珠在至少三個波長各取 10 顆珠的 PSF，計算半高寬平均與標準差，排除珠子大小的貢獻（以 √(FWHM² − d²) 近似去卷積）；把量測的 PSF 與由設計 Zernike 係數模擬的 PSF 比較，兩者半高寬差異應在 5% 內。","textEn":"Acquire PSFs of at least 10 beads from the same 100 nm batch at three or more wavelengths, compute the mean and standard deviation of the widths and remove the bead-size contribution with the approximation √(FWHM² − d²); compare the measured PSF with the PSF simulated from the design Zernike coefficients, where the widths should agree within 5%.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以同一批 100 nm 珠在至少三個波長各取 10 顆珠的 PSF，計算半高寬平均與標準差，排除珠子大小的貢獻（以 √(FWHM² − d²) 近似去卷積）。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Acquire PSFs of at least 10 beads from the same 100 nm batch at three or more wavelengths, compute the mean and standard deviation of the widths and remove the bead-size contribution with the approximation √(FWHM² − d²).","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以同一批 100 nm 珠在至少三個波長各取 10 顆珠的 PSF，計算半高寬平均與標準差，排除珠子大小的貢獻（以 √(FWHM² − d²) 近似去卷積）；把量測的 PSF 與由設計 Zernike 係數模擬的 PSF 比較，兩者半高寬差異應在 5% 內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Acquire PSFs of at least 10 beads from the same 100 nm batch at three or more wavelengths, compute the mean and standard deviation of the widths and remove the bead-size contribution with the approximation √(FWHM² − d²); compare the measured PSF with the PSF simulated from the design Zernike coefficients, where the widths should agree within 5%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a406-v12-20","title":"PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「多波長 PSF 量測台」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Multi-wavelength PSF measurement bench” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若用厚度 150 µm 的蓋玻片測試設計給 170 µm 的物鏡，球差讓軸向 PSF 不對稱並拉長 50% 以上，測試報告判定物鏡不良，實際上是測試條件錯誤。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Testing an objective designed for a 170 µm cover glass with a 150 µm one introduces spherical aberration that makes the axial PSF asymmetric and over 50% longer, so the report condemns a good objective when the test condition was wrong. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：量測時蓋玻片厚度、浸油折射率與溫度都必須和設計條件一致，否則量到的是測試條件的像差而非物鏡的像差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Cover-glass thickness, oil index and temperature during the test must match the design conditions, otherwise the measured aberration belongs to the test setup rather than to the objective.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若用厚度 150 µm 的蓋玻片測試設計給 170 µm 的物鏡，球差讓軸向 PSF 不對稱並拉長 50% 以上，測試報告判定物鏡不良，實際上是測試條件錯誤。","textEn":"Testing an objective designed for a 170 µm cover glass with a 150 µm one introduces spherical aberration that makes the axial PSF asymmetric and over 50% longer, so the report condemns a good objective when the test condition was wrong.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「PSF、Strehl 與軸向色差的量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Measuring PSF, Strehl and axial colour\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。","若用厚度 150 µm 的蓋玻片測試設計給 170 µm 的物鏡，球差讓軸向 PSF 不對稱並拉長 50% 以上，測試報告判定物鏡不良，實際上是測試條件錯誤。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.","Testing an objective designed for a 170 µm cover glass with a 150 µm one introduces spherical aberration that makes the axial PSF asymmetric and over 50% longer, so the report condemns a good objective when the test condition was wrong."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若用厚度 150 µm 的蓋玻片測試設計給 170 µm 的物鏡，球差讓軸向 PSF 不對稱並拉長 50% 以上，測試報告判定物鏡不良，實際上是測試條件錯誤。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Testing an objective designed for a 170 µm cover glass with a 150 µm one introduces spherical aberration that makes the axial PSF asymmetric and over 50% longer, so the report condemns a good objective when the test condition was wrong. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a406-v12-21","title":"蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"物鏡以特定蓋玻片厚度（通常 0.17 mm）與浸液折射率設計，任何厚度偏差或折射率失配都會引入與 NA 四次方成正比的球差，高 NA 乾式物鏡對此最敏感，因此配有校正環改變一組鏡片的間距來抵消。油浸物鏡在蓋玻片與油折射率匹配時對厚度不敏感，但觀察水性試樣深處時，水與油的折射率差會隨深度累積球差。誤差預算要把這些使用條件項與物鏡本身的殘差一起列入。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An objective is designed for a specific cover-glass thickness (usually 0.17 mm) and immersion index, and any thickness deviation or index mismatch introduces spherical aberration proportional to the fourth power of NA, to which high-NA dry objectives are most sensitive, hence a correction collar that shifts one lens group to cancel it. Oil objectives are insensitive to cover-glass thickness when oil and glass indices match, but imaging deep into aqueous specimens accumulates spherical aberration with depth from the water-oil index difference. The error budget must list these usage-condition terms alongside the objective's own residuals. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：平行平板引入的三階球差 W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴：n = 1.515 時 (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466；乾式 NA 0.95 的 NA⁴ = 0.81，厚度誤差 Δt = 10 µm 給 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm 的峰值波前，重新對焦後 RMS ≈ W₀₄₀/13.4 ≈ 28 nm；Δt = 20 µm 時約 56 nm，超過 λ/14 = 39 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A plane-parallel plate adds third-order spherical aberration W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴: for n = 1.515, (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466; a dry NA 0.95 objective has NA⁴ = 0.81, so a thickness error Δt = 10 µm gives 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm of peak wavefront, about 28 nm RMS after refocus (W₀₄₀/13.4); Δt = 20 µm gives about 56 nm, beyond λ/14 = 39 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-21-k1","title":"蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算","titleEn":"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget","text":"物鏡以特定蓋玻片厚度（通常 0.17 mm）與浸液折射率設計，任何厚度偏差或折射率失配都會引入與 NA 四次方成正比的球差，高 NA 乾式物鏡對此最敏感，因此配有校正環改變一組鏡片的間距來抵消。油浸物鏡在蓋玻片與油折射率匹配時對厚度不敏感，但觀察水性試樣深處時，水與油的折射率差會隨深度累積球差。","textEn":"An objective is designed for a specific cover-glass thickness (usually 0.17 mm) and immersion index, and any thickness deviation or index mismatch introduces spherical aberration proportional to the fourth power of NA, to which high-NA dry objectives are most sensitive, hence a correction collar that shifts one lens group to cancel it. Oil objectives are insensitive to cover-glass thickness when oil and glass indices match, but imaging deep into aqueous specimens accumulates spherical aberration with depth from the water-oil index difference.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget\" is correct?","options":["物鏡以特定蓋玻片厚度（通常 0.17 mm）與浸液折射率設計，任何厚度偏差或折射率失配都會引入與 NA 四次方成正比的球差，高 NA 乾式物鏡對此最敏感，因此配有校正環改變一組鏡片的間距來抵消。","油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。","物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。"],"optionsEn":["An objective is designed for a specific cover-glass thickness (usually 0.17 mm) and immersion index, and any thickness deviation or index mismatch introduces spherical aberration proportional to the fourth power of NA, to which high-NA dry objectives are most sensitive, hence a correction collar that shifts one lens group to cancel it.","Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.","The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope."],"answer":0,"explanation":"物鏡以特定蓋玻片厚度（通常 0.17 mm）與浸液折射率設計，任何厚度偏差或折射率失配都會引入與 NA 四次方成正比的球差，高 NA 乾式物鏡對此最敏感，因此配有校正環改變一組鏡片的間距來抵消。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An objective is designed for a specific cover-glass thickness (usually 0.17 mm) and immersion index, and any thickness deviation or index mismatch introduces spherical aberration proportional to the fourth power of NA, to which high-NA dry objectives are most sensitive, hence a correction collar that shifts one lens group to cancel it. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a406-v12-22","title":"蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：平行平板引入的三階球差 W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴：n = 1.515 時 (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466；乾式 NA 0.95 的 NA⁴ = 0.81，厚度誤差 Δt = 10 µm 給 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm 的峰值波前，重新對焦後 RMS ≈ W₀₄₀/13.4 ≈ 28 nm；Δt = 20 µm 時約 56 nm，超過 λ/14 = 39 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A plane-parallel plate adds third-order spherical aberration W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴: for n = 1.515, (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466; a dry NA 0.95 objective has NA⁴ = 0.81, so a thickness error Δt = 10 µm gives 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm of peak wavefront, about 28 nm RMS after refocus (W₀₄₀/13.4); Δt = 20 µm gives about 56 nm, beyond λ/14 = 39 nm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用一組已知厚度（150、170、190 µm）的蓋玻片放置同樣的螢光珠，對每一片記錄軸向 PSF 並量不對稱度，驗證球差隨厚度偏差線性變化；再轉動校正環找出每個厚度的最佳設定，建立校正環刻度對實際厚度的對照表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the same fluorescent beads under cover glasses of known thickness (150, 170 and 190 µm), record the axial PSF for each and quantify its asymmetry to verify that spherical aberration varies linearly with thickness deviation; then rotate the correction collar to find the best setting for each thickness and build a table relating collar scale to actual thickness.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"平行平板引入的三階球差 W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴：n = 1.515 時 (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466；乾式 NA 0.95 的 NA⁴ = 0.81，厚度誤差 Δt = 10 µm 給 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm 的峰值波前，重新對焦後 RMS ≈ W₀₄₀/13.4 ≈ 28 nm；Δt = 20 µm 時約 56 nm，超過 λ/14 = 39 nm。","textEn":"A plane-parallel plate adds third-order spherical aberration W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴: for n = 1.515, (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466; a dry NA 0.95 objective has NA⁴ = 0.81, so a thickness error Δt = 10 µm gives 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm of peak wavefront, about 28 nm RMS after refocus (W₀₄₀/13.4); Δt = 20 µm gives about 56 nm, beyond λ/14 = 39 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","平行平板引入的三階球差 W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴：n = 1.515 時 (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。"],"optionsEn":["Higher magnification always means better resolution.","A plane-parallel plate adds third-order spherical aberration W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴: for n = 1.515, (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466.","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission."],"answer":1,"explanation":"平行平板引入的三階球差 W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴：n = 1.515 時 (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466；乾式 NA 0.95 的 NA⁴ = 0.81，厚度誤差 Δt = 10 µm 給 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm 的峰值波前，重新對焦後 RMS ≈ W₀₄₀/13.4 ≈ 28 nm；Δt = 20 µm 時約 56 nm，超過 λ/14 = 39 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A plane-parallel plate adds third-order spherical aberration W₀₄₀ ≈ Δt·(n² − 1)/(8n³)·NA⁴: for n = 1.515, (n² − 1)/(8n³) ≈ 0.0466; a dry NA 0.95 objective has NA⁴ = 0.81, so a thickness error Δt = 10 µm gives 0.0466×0.81×10 µm ≈ 0.38 µm of peak wavefront, about 28 nm RMS after refocus (W₀₄₀/13.4); Δt = 20 µm gives about 56 nm, beyond λ/14 = 39 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a406-v12-23","title":"蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用一組已知厚度（150、170、190 µm）的蓋玻片放置同樣的螢光珠，對每一片記錄軸向 PSF 並量不對稱度，驗證球差隨厚度偏差線性變化；再轉動校正環找出每個厚度的最佳設定，建立校正環刻度對實際厚度的對照表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the same fluorescent beads under cover glasses of known thickness (150, 170 and 190 µm), record the axial PSF for each and quantify its asymmetry to verify that spherical aberration varies linearly with thickness deviation; then rotate the correction collar to find the best setting for each thickness and build a table relating collar scale to actual thickness. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：在 37 °C 的活細胞實驗中，浸油折射率比 23 °C 時低約 0.005，與蓋玻片失配後產生的球差隨成像深度累積，30 µm 深處的訊號強度與解析度明顯下降，常被誤判為試樣散射。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: In live-cell work at 37 °C the immersion-oil index is about 0.005 lower than at 23 °C, the resulting mismatch with the cover glass accumulates spherical aberration with imaging depth, and signal and resolution at 30 µm depth drop visibly, often misattributed to specimen scattering.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用一組已知厚度（150、170、190 µm）的蓋玻片放置同樣的螢光珠，對每一片記錄軸向 PSF 並量不對稱度，驗證球差隨厚度偏差線性變化；再轉動校正環找出每個厚度的最佳設定，建立校正環刻度對實際厚度的對照表。","textEn":"Place the same fluorescent beads under cover glasses of known thickness (150, 170 and 190 µm), record the axial PSF for each and quantify its asymmetry to verify that spherical aberration varies linearly with thickness deviation; then rotate the correction collar to find the best setting for each thickness and build a table relating collar scale to actual thickness.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。","用一組已知厚度（150、170、190 µm）的蓋玻片放置同樣的螢光珠，對每一片記錄軸向 PSF 並量不對稱度，驗證球差隨厚度偏差線性變化。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.","Place the same fluorescent beads under cover glasses of known thickness (150, 170 and 190 µm), record the axial PSF for each and quantify its asymmetry to verify that spherical aberration varies linearly with thickness deviation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用一組已知厚度（150、170、190 µm）的蓋玻片放置同樣的螢光珠，對每一片記錄軸向 PSF 並量不對稱度，驗證球差隨厚度偏差線性變化；再轉動校正環找出每個厚度的最佳設定，建立校正環刻度對實際厚度的對照表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the same fluorescent beads under cover glasses of known thickness (150, 170 and 190 µm), record the axial PSF for each and quantify its asymmetry to verify that spherical aberration varies linearly with thickness deviation; then rotate the correction collar to find the best setting for each thickness and build a table relating collar scale to actual thickness. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a406-v12-24","title":"蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「蓋玻片厚度與校正環」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Cover-glass thickness and correction collar” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"在 37 °C 的活細胞實驗中，浸油折射率比 23 °C 時低約 0.005，與蓋玻片失配後產生的球差隨成像深度累積，30 µm 深處的訊號強度與解析度明顯下降，常被誤判為試樣散射。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"In live-cell work at 37 °C the immersion-oil index is about 0.005 lower than at 23 °C, the resulting mismatch with the cover glass accumulates spherical aberration with imaging depth, and signal and resolution at 30 µm depth drop visibly, often misattributed to specimen scattering. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：誤差預算要把這些使用條件項與物鏡本身的殘差一起列入。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The error budget must list these usage-condition terms alongside the objective's own residuals.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在 37 °C 的活細胞實驗中，浸油折射率比 23 °C 時低約 0.005，與蓋玻片失配後產生的球差隨成像深度累積，30 µm 深處的訊號強度與解析度明顯下降，常被誤判為試樣散射。","textEn":"In live-cell work at 37 °C the immersion-oil index is about 0.005 lower than at 23 °C, the resulting mismatch with the cover glass accumulates spherical aberration with imaging depth, and signal and resolution at 30 µm depth drop visibly, often misattributed to specimen scattering.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「蓋玻片球差、折射率失配與誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cover-glass spherical aberration, index mismatch and the error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["在 37 °C 的活細胞實驗中，浸油折射率比 23 °C 時低約 0.005，與蓋玻片失配後產生的球差隨成像深度累積，30 µm 深處的訊號強度與解析度明顯下降，常被誤判為試樣散射。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。"],"optionsEn":["In live-cell work at 37 °C the immersion-oil index is about 0.005 lower than at 23 °C, the resulting mismatch with the cover glass accumulates spherical aberration with imaging depth, and signal and resolution at 30 µm depth drop visibly, often misattributed to specimen scattering.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 37 °C 的活細胞實驗中，浸油折射率比 23 °C 時低約 0.005，與蓋玻片失配後產生的球差隨成像深度累積，30 µm 深處的訊號強度與解析度明顯下降，常被誤判為試樣散射。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In live-cell work at 37 °C the immersion-oil index is about 0.005 lower than at 23 °C, the resulting mismatch with the cover glass accumulates spherical aberration with imaging depth, and signal and resolution at 30 µm depth drop visibly, often misattributed to specimen scattering. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a406-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差」與「Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour\" and \"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a406-v12-25","title":"無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"現代物鏡為無限遠校正：物鏡把試樣成像到無窮遠，由筒鏡（焦距依廠牌為 164.5、180 或 200 mm）成像到中間像面，標稱倍率等於筒鏡焦距除以物鏡焦距。物鏡與筒鏡是一組被整體設計的系統，橫向色差（放大率隨波長變化）可能在物鏡內校正，也可能留給筒鏡補償，因此混用不同廠牌會引入橫向色差。齊焦距離、螺紋規格、視場數與後焦面位置都是整合時必須一致的介面參數。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Modern objectives are infinity-corrected: the objective images the specimen to infinity and a tube lens (164.5, 180 or 200 mm focal length depending on the maker) forms the intermediate image, with nominal magnification equal to tube-lens focal length divided by objective focal length. Objective and tube lens are designed as one system, and lateral colour (magnification varying with wavelength) may be corrected inside the objective or left for the tube lens to compensate, so mixing makers introduces lateral colour. Parfocal distance, thread standard, field number and back-focal-plane position are the interface parameters that must agree during integration. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：筒鏡 200 mm 配 100× 物鏡時 f_obj = 2 mm；視場數 25 mm 對應試樣面視場直徑 25/100 = 0.25 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 200 mm tube lens with a 100× objective implies f_obj = 2 mm; a field number of 25 mm corresponds to a specimen-plane field diameter of 25/100 = 0.25 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-25-k1","title":"無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差","titleEn":"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour","text":"現代物鏡為無限遠校正：物鏡把試樣成像到無窮遠，由筒鏡（焦距依廠牌為 164.5、180 或 200 mm）成像到中間像面，標稱倍率等於筒鏡焦距除以物鏡焦距。物鏡與筒鏡是一組被整體設計的系統，橫向色差（放大率隨波長變化）可能在物鏡內校正，也可能留給筒鏡補償，因此混用不同廠牌會引入橫向色差。","textEn":"Modern objectives are infinity-corrected: the objective images the specimen to infinity and a tube lens (164.5, 180 or 200 mm focal length depending on the maker) forms the intermediate image, with nominal magnification equal to tube-lens focal length divided by objective focal length. Objective and tube lens are designed as one system, and lateral colour (magnification varying with wavelength) may be corrected inside the objective or left for the tube lens to compensate, so mixing makers introduces lateral colour.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour\" is correct?","options":["物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。","現代物鏡為無限遠校正：物鏡把試樣成像到無窮遠，由筒鏡（焦距依廠牌為 164.5、180 或 200 mm）成像到中間像面，標稱倍率等於筒鏡焦距除以物鏡焦距。","物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。"],"optionsEn":["The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope.","Modern objectives are infinity-corrected: the objective images the specimen to infinity and a tube lens (164.5, 180 or 200 mm focal length depending on the maker) forms the intermediate image, with nominal magnification equal to tube-lens focal length divided by objective focal length.","An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"現代物鏡為無限遠校正：物鏡把試樣成像到無窮遠，由筒鏡（焦距依廠牌為 164.5、180 或 200 mm）成像到中間像面，標稱倍率等於筒鏡焦距除以物鏡焦距。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Modern objectives are infinity-corrected: the objective images the specimen to infinity and a tube lens (164.5, 180 or 200 mm focal length depending on the maker) forms the intermediate image, with nominal magnification equal to tube-lens focal length divided by objective focal length. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a406-v12-26","title":"無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差：定量估算","titleEn":"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：筒鏡 200 mm 配 100× 物鏡時 f_obj = 2 mm；視場數 25 mm 對應試樣面視場直徑 25/100 = 0.25 mm。若混用廠牌造成 486 與 656 nm 之間 0.1% 的放大率差，視場邊緣（離軸 125 µm）的紅藍影像橫向錯位 125 µm×0.001 = 125 nm，已超過半個解析極限。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 200 mm tube lens with a 100× objective implies f_obj = 2 mm; a field number of 25 mm corresponds to a specimen-plane field diameter of 25/100 = 0.25 mm. If mixing makers produces a 0.1% magnification difference between 486 and 656 nm, the red and blue images at the field edge (125 µm off axis) are displaced laterally by 125 µm×0.001 = 125 nm, more than half the resolution limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在視場邊緣以多色螢光珠記錄紅、綠、藍通道影像，量測各通道質心的徑向位置差並對離軸距離作圖，斜率即橫向色差的放大率差；同時用刻度尺標定實際倍率，確認筒鏡焦距與物鏡匹配。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record red, green and blue channel images of multicolour beads at the field edge, measure the radial centroid difference between channels and plot it against off-axis distance, where the slope gives the magnification difference of lateral colour; calibrate the actual magnification with a stage micrometer to confirm that tube-lens focal length and objective are matched.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"筒鏡 200 mm 配 100× 物鏡時 f_obj = 2 mm；視場數 25 mm 對應試樣面視場直徑 25/100 = 0.25 mm。若混用廠牌造成 486 與 656 nm 之間 0.1% 的放大率差，視場邊緣（離軸 125 µm）的紅藍影像橫向錯位 125 µm×0.001 = 125 nm，已超過半個解析極限。","textEn":"A 200 mm tube lens with a 100× objective implies f_obj = 2 mm; a field number of 25 mm corresponds to a specimen-plane field diameter of 25/100 = 0.25 mm. If mixing makers produces a 0.1% magnification difference between 486 and 656 nm, the red and blue images at the field edge (125 µm off axis) are displaced laterally by 125 µm×0.001 = 125 nm, more than half the resolution limit.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour\", which statement holds?","options":["只要鏡片數量夠多，用普通玻璃也能消除二級光譜。","鏡片多幾片沒關係，鍍膜損失可以忽略。","筒鏡 200 mm 配 100× 物鏡時 f_obj = 2 mm；視場數 25 mm 對應試樣面視場直徑 25/100 = 0.25 mm。"],"optionsEn":["With enough elements, ordinary glasses can remove the secondary spectrum.","A few extra elements do not matter because coating losses are negligible.","A 200 mm tube lens with a 100× objective implies f_obj = 2 mm; a field number of 25 mm corresponds to a specimen-plane field diameter of 25/100 = 0.25 mm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"筒鏡 200 mm 配 100× 物鏡時 f_obj = 2 mm；視場數 25 mm 對應試樣面視場直徑 25/100 = 0.25 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 200 mm tube lens with a 100× objective implies f_obj = 2 mm; a field number of 25 mm corresponds to a specimen-plane field diameter of 25/100 = 0.25 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a406-v12-27","title":"無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在視場邊緣以多色螢光珠記錄紅、綠、藍通道影像，量測各通道質心的徑向位置差並對離軸距離作圖，斜率即橫向色差的放大率差；同時用刻度尺標定實際倍率，確認筒鏡焦距與物鏡匹配。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record red, green and blue channel images of multicolour beads at the field edge, measure the radial centroid difference between channels and plot it against off-axis distance, where the slope gives the magnification difference of lateral colour; calibrate the actual magnification with a stage micrometer to confirm that tube-lens focal length and objective are matched. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把為 180 mm 筒鏡設計的物鏡裝在 200 mm 筒鏡的顯微鏡上，倍率變成 111× 而非 100×，若軟體仍以 100× 計算像素尺寸，所有長度量測都有 11% 的系統誤差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Mounting an objective designed for a 180 mm tube lens on a microscope with a 200 mm tube lens yields 111× instead of 100×, and if software still assumes 100× for pixel size, every length measurement carries an 11% systematic error.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在視場邊緣以多色螢光珠記錄紅、綠、藍通道影像，量測各通道質心的徑向位置差並對離軸距離作圖，斜率即橫向色差的放大率差；同時用刻度尺標定實際倍率，確認筒鏡焦距與物鏡匹配。","textEn":"Record red, green and blue channel images of multicolour beads at the field edge, measure the radial centroid difference between channels and plot it against off-axis distance, where the slope gives the magnification difference of lateral colour; calibrate the actual magnification with a stage micrometer to confirm that tube-lens focal length and objective are matched.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour\"?","options":["在視場邊緣以多色螢光珠記錄紅、綠、藍通道影像，量測各通道質心的徑向位置差並對離軸距離作圖，斜率即橫向色差的放大率差。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。"],"optionsEn":["Record red, green and blue channel images of multicolour beads at the field edge, measure the radial centroid difference between channels and plot it against off-axis distance, where the slope gives the magnification difference of lateral colour.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在視場邊緣以多色螢光珠記錄紅、綠、藍通道影像，量測各通道質心的徑向位置差並對離軸距離作圖，斜率即橫向色差的放大率差；同時用刻度尺標定實際倍率，確認筒鏡焦距與物鏡匹配。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record red, green and blue channel images of multicolour beads at the field edge, measure the radial centroid difference between channels and plot it against off-axis distance, where the slope gives the magnification difference of lateral colour; calibrate the actual magnification with a stage micrometer to confirm that tube-lens focal length and objective are matched. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a406-v12-28","title":"無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「筒鏡、齊焦距離與視場數」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Tube lens, parfocal distance and field number” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把為 180 mm 筒鏡設計的物鏡裝在 200 mm 筒鏡的顯微鏡上，倍率變成 111× 而非 100×，若軟體仍以 100× 計算像素尺寸，所有長度量測都有 11% 的系統誤差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Mounting an objective designed for a 180 mm tube lens on a microscope with a 200 mm tube lens yields 111× instead of 100×, and if software still assumes 100× for pixel size, every length measurement carries an 11% systematic error. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：齊焦距離、螺紋規格、視場數與後焦面位置都是整合時必須一致的介面參數。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Parfocal distance, thread standard, field number and back-focal-plane position are the interface parameters that must agree during integration.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「物鏡上標的倍率在任何顯微鏡上都成立。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The magnification engraved on an objective holds on any microscope.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把為 180 mm 筒鏡設計的物鏡裝在 200 mm 筒鏡的顯微鏡上，倍率變成 111× 而非 100×，若軟體仍以 100× 計算像素尺寸，所有長度量測都有 11% 的系統誤差。","textEn":"Mounting an objective designed for a 180 mm tube lens on a microscope with a 200 mm tube lens yields 111× instead of 100×, and if software still assumes 100× for pixel size, every length measurement carries an 11% systematic error.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「無限遠共軛系統整合與橫向色差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Infinity-conjugate system integration and lateral colour\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","把為 180 mm 筒鏡設計的物鏡裝在 200 mm 筒鏡的顯微鏡上，倍率變成 111× 而非 100×，若軟體仍以 100× 計算像素尺寸，所有長度量測都有 11% 的系統誤差。","物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Mounting an objective designed for a 180 mm tube lens on a microscope with a 200 mm tube lens yields 111× instead of 100×, and if software still assumes 100× for pixel size, every length measurement carries an 11% systematic error.","An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把為 180 mm 筒鏡設計的物鏡裝在 200 mm 筒鏡的顯微鏡上，倍率變成 111× 而非 100×，若軟體仍以 100× 計算像素尺寸，所有長度量測都有 11% 的系統誤差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mounting an objective designed for a 180 mm tube lens on a microscope with a 200 mm tube lens yields 111× instead of 100×, and if software still assumes 100× for pixel size, every length measurement carries an 11% systematic error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a406-v12-29","title":"Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「物鏡驗收資料表」如何決定複消色差顯微物鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Objective acceptance data sheet” determines the key performance of “Apochromatic microscope objectives”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"物鏡出貨前的驗收把所有量測整合成一份資料表：各波長的軸上 Strehl 與 Zernike 係數、軸向與橫向色差、視場平坦度、透過率曲線、工作距離與齊焦距離實測值，以及測試時的蓋玻片厚度、浸液與溫度。系統整合者再把物鏡殘差、筒鏡、對準與使用條件以均方根合成，判斷整機能否維持 Strehl 0.8。交接時必須連同測試條件一起移交，否則後續的現場量測無法與出廠值比較。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「物鏡驗收資料表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pre-shipment acceptance consolidates every measurement into one data sheet: on-axis Strehl and Zernike coefficients per wavelength, axial and lateral colour, field flatness, transmission curve, measured working and parfocal distances, and the cover-glass thickness, immersion and temperature used in testing. The system integrator then combines objective residual, tube lens, alignment and usage conditions in quadrature to judge whether the whole instrument keeps Strehl at 0.8. The test conditions must be handed over with the data, otherwise later field measurements cannot be compared with factory values. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Objective acceptance data sheet”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：RMS 波前預算：物鏡殘差 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片與浸液殘差 20 nm，RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm，恰在 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm 之內；Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: RMS wavefront budget: objective residual 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass plus immersion residual 20 nm give RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm, just inside λ/14 ≈ 39 nm; Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83.","failure":"常見誤解：「物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「物鏡驗收資料表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Objective acceptance data sheet”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-29-k1","title":"Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接","titleEn":"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff","text":"物鏡出貨前的驗收把所有量測整合成一份資料表：各波長的軸上 Strehl 與 Zernike 係數、軸向與橫向色差、視場平坦度、透過率曲線、工作距離與齊焦距離實測值，以及測試時的蓋玻片厚度、浸液與溫度。系統整合者再把物鏡殘差、筒鏡、對準與使用條件以均方根合成，判斷整機能否維持 Strehl 0.8。","textEn":"Pre-shipment acceptance consolidates every measurement into one data sheet: on-axis Strehl and Zernike coefficients per wavelength, axial and lateral colour, field flatness, transmission curve, measured working and parfocal distances, and the cover-glass thickness, immersion and temperature used in testing. The system integrator then combines objective residual, tube lens, alignment and usage conditions in quadrature to judge whether the whole instrument keeps Strehl at 0.8.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff\" is correct?","options":["物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。","放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","物鏡出貨前的驗收把所有量測整合成一份資料表：各波長的軸上 Strehl 與 Zernike 係數、軸向與橫向色差、視場平坦度、透過率曲線、工作距離與齊焦距離實測值，以及測試時的蓋玻片厚度、浸液與溫度。"],"optionsEn":["An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions.","Higher magnification always means better resolution.","Pre-shipment acceptance consolidates every measurement into one data sheet: on-axis Strehl and Zernike coefficients per wavelength, axial and lateral colour, field flatness, transmission curve, measured working and parfocal distances, and the cover-glass thickness, immersion and temperature used in testing."],"answer":2,"explanation":"物鏡出貨前的驗收把所有量測整合成一份資料表：各波長的軸上 Strehl 與 Zernike 係數、軸向與橫向色差、視場平坦度、透過率曲線、工作距離與齊焦距離實測值，以及測試時的蓋玻片厚度、浸液與溫度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pre-shipment acceptance consolidates every measurement into one data sheet: on-axis Strehl and Zernike coefficients per wavelength, axial and lateral colour, field flatness, transmission curve, measured working and parfocal distances, and the cover-glass thickness, immersion and temperature used in testing. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a406-v12-30","title":"Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「物鏡驗收資料表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Objective acceptance data sheet” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：RMS 波前預算：物鏡殘差 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片與浸液殘差 20 nm，RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm，恰在 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm 之內；Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83。若蓋玻片項放寬到 30 nm，RSS ≈ 44 nm，Strehl 降到約 0.78。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: RMS wavefront budget: objective residual 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass plus immersion residual 20 nm give RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm, just inside λ/14 ≈ 39 nm; Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83. Relaxing the cover-glass term to 30 nm raises the RSS to about 44 nm and drops Strehl to about 0.78. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在整合後的顯微鏡上重複出廠的 PSF 與色差量測，使用相同的珠子、蓋玻片與浸液，比較 Strehl 與軸向色差是否在出廠值的不確定度內；逐項核對資料表的測試條件、日期與儀器，並把現場量測結果附在交接文件中作為新的基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Repeat the factory PSF and chromatic measurements on the integrated microscope with the same beads, cover glass and immersion, and compare Strehl and axial colour with the factory values within their uncertainty; check the test conditions, dates and instruments on the data sheet item by item and attach the field results to the handoff record as the new baseline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"RMS 波前預算：物鏡殘差 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片與浸液殘差 20 nm，RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm，恰在 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm 之內；Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83。若蓋玻片項放寬到 30 nm，RSS ≈ 44 nm，Strehl 降到約 0.78。","textEn":"RMS wavefront budget: objective residual 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass plus immersion residual 20 nm give RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm, just inside λ/14 ≈ 39 nm; Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83. Relaxing the cover-glass term to 30 nm raises the RSS to about 44 nm and drops Strehl to about 0.78.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["RMS 波前預算：物鏡殘差 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片與浸液殘差 20 nm，RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm，恰在 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm 之內。","螢石鏡片只是為了讓透過率更高。","量一個波長的 PSF 就足以驗證複消色差物鏡。"],"optionsEn":["RMS wavefront budget: objective residual 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass plus immersion residual 20 nm give RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm, just inside λ/14 ≈ 39 nm.","Fluorite elements are used only to raise transmission.","A single-wavelength PSF measurement suffices to qualify an apochromat."],"answer":0,"explanation":"RMS 波前預算：物鏡殘差 25 nm、筒鏡 15 nm、對準 15 nm、蓋玻片與浸液殘差 20 nm，RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm，恰在 λ/14 ≈ 39 nm 之內；Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"RMS wavefront budget: objective residual 25 nm, tube lens 15 nm, alignment 15 nm and cover-glass plus immersion residual 20 nm give RSS = √(625+225+225+400) = √1475 ≈ 38 nm, just inside λ/14 ≈ 39 nm; Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π×38/550)²] = exp(−0.189) ≈ 0.83. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a406-v12-31","title":"Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「物鏡驗收資料表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Objective acceptance data sheet” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在整合後的顯微鏡上重複出廠的 PSF 與色差量測，使用相同的珠子、蓋玻片與浸液，比較 Strehl 與軸向色差是否在出廠值的不確定度內；逐項核對資料表的測試條件、日期與儀器，並把現場量測結果附在交接文件中作為新的基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Repeat the factory PSF and chromatic measurements on the integrated microscope with the same beads, cover glass and immersion, and compare Strehl and axial colour with the factory values within their uncertainty; check the test conditions, dates and instruments on the data sheet item by item and attach the field results to the handoff record as the new baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：資料表若只給一個總 Strehl 值而未註明波長與蓋玻片條件，現場用不同波長量到 0.7 時無法判斷是物鏡退化、筒鏡不匹配還是測試條件不同，爭議只能靠返廠重測解決。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the data sheet gives a single Strehl value without wavelength and cover-glass conditions, a field measurement of 0.7 at another wavelength cannot be attributed to objective degradation, tube-lens mismatch or test conditions, and the dispute can only be settled by returning the objective for retest.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在整合後的顯微鏡上重複出廠的 PSF 與色差量測，使用相同的珠子、蓋玻片與浸液，比較 Strehl 與軸向色差是否在出廠值的不確定度內；逐項核對資料表的測試條件、日期與儀器，並把現場量測結果附在交接文件中作為新的基準。","textEn":"Repeat the factory PSF and chromatic measurements on the integrated microscope with the same beads, cover glass and immersion, and compare Strehl and axial colour with the factory values within their uncertainty; check the test conditions, dates and instruments on the data sheet item by item and attach the field results to the handoff record as the new baseline.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在整合後的顯微鏡上重複出廠的 PSF 與色差量測，使用相同的珠子、蓋玻片與浸液，比較 Strehl 與軸向色差是否在出廠值的不確定度內。","油浸物鏡對任何試樣深度都沒有球差。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Repeat the factory PSF and chromatic measurements on the integrated microscope with the same beads, cover glass and immersion, and compare Strehl and axial colour with the factory values within their uncertainty.","Oil-immersion objectives are free of spherical aberration at any specimen depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在整合後的顯微鏡上重複出廠的 PSF 與色差量測，使用相同的珠子、蓋玻片與浸液，比較 Strehl 與軸向色差是否在出廠值的不確定度內；逐項核對資料表的測試條件、日期與儀器，並把現場量測結果附在交接文件中作為新的基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Repeat the factory PSF and chromatic measurements on the integrated microscope with the same beads, cover glass and immersion, and compare Strehl and axial colour with the factory values within their uncertainty; check the test conditions, dates and instruments on the data sheet item by item and attach the field results to the handoff record as the new baseline. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a406-v12-32","title":"Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"prerequisiteIds":["a406-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「物鏡驗收資料表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Objective acceptance data sheet” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"資料表若只給一個總 Strehl 值而未註明波長與蓋玻片條件，現場用不同波長量到 0.7 時無法判斷是物鏡退化、筒鏡不匹配還是測試條件不同，爭議只能靠返廠重測解決。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the data sheet gives a single Strehl value without wavelength and cover-glass conditions, a field measurement of 0.7 at another wavelength cannot be attributed to objective degradation, tube-lens mismatch or test conditions, and the dispute can only be settled by returning the objective for retest. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接時必須連同測試條件一起移交，否則後續的現場量測無法與出廠值比較。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The test conditions must be handed over with the data, otherwise later field measurements cannot be compared with factory values.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「物鏡的 Strehl 是固定常數，與使用條件無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An objective's Strehl is a fixed constant independent of usage conditions.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a406-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"資料表若只給一個總 Strehl 值而未註明波長與蓋玻片條件，現場用不同波長量到 0.7 時無法判斷是物鏡退化、筒鏡不匹配還是測試條件不同，爭議只能靠返廠重測解決。","textEn":"If the data sheet gives a single Strehl value without wavelength and cover-glass conditions, a field measurement of 0.7 at another wavelength cannot be attributed to objective degradation, tube-lens mismatch or test conditions, and the dispute can only be settled by returning the objective for retest.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]},{"id":"a406-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Strehl 預算、驗收報告與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Strehl budget, acceptance report and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","放大倍率越高，解析度就一定越好。","資料表若只給一個總 Strehl 值而未註明波長與蓋玻片條件，現場用不同波長量到 0.7 時無法判斷是物鏡退化、筒鏡不匹配還是測試條件不同，爭議只能靠返廠重測解決。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Higher magnification always means better resolution.","If the data sheet gives a single Strehl value without wavelength and cover-glass conditions, a field measurement of 0.7 at another wavelength cannot be attributed to objective degradation, tube-lens mismatch or test conditions, and the dispute can only be settled by returning the objective for retest."],"answer":2,"explanation":"資料表若只給一個總 Strehl 值而未註明波長與蓋玻片條件，現場用不同波長量到 0.7 時無法判斷是物鏡退化、筒鏡不匹配還是測試條件不同，爭議只能靠返廠重測解決。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the data sheet gives a single Strehl value without wavelength and cover-glass conditions, a field measurement of 0.7 at another wavelength cannot be attributed to objective degradation, tube-lens mismatch or test conditions, and the dispute can only be settled by returning the objective for retest. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-evident-objective-specs","v12o-zeiss-campus-objectives","v12o-zeiss-objective-specifications","v12o-schott-tie29-arizona"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
